Error [E0001]: `\r` isn't an escape Jet knows
  --> char_escape_carriage_return.jet:3:18
    |
  3 |     carriage :: '\r'
    |                  ^^
 Why: Inside a character literal, `\` starts an escape: `\n`, `\t`, `\'`, `\\`
 Fix: Use a supported escape or a plain character
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0001
